  "body": "Behind a classic white picket fence, this brand-new home pairs a striking stone and weatherboard façade with a light, beautifully detailed interior.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is one sunlit open-plan space for living, dining and cooking. Wide-plank oak-look floors, panelled walls, cornices and a heat pump give it warmth and character. The kitchen is the centrepiece: a curved, fluted island with brass pendants above, and white cabinetry with brushed brass handles. A brass gooseneck mixer sits alongside a filtered water tap, and a handmade-look glazed tile splashback is lit by under-cabinet lighting. There’s a wall oven, built-in microwave, dishwasher, integrated rangehood and generous tall storage. A guest WC and separate laundry are tucked neatly away.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a second living area gives everyone room to spread out. The master suite opens to its own balcony and has a walk-in wardrobe, an ensuite and its own heat pump. The two further bedrooms both have built-in robes. Both bathrooms are finished to a high standard, with soft stone-look tiles, terrazzo floors, brushed tapware and curved timber vanities. The family bathroom has a separate bath and shower, plus a heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced front lawn has garden beds and a stepping-stone path, a great spot for kids or pets. A single garage with internal access, a keyless digital lock and security cameras round out the package. For complete peace of mind, the home comes with a 10-year Stamford warranty.\r\n\r\nFamilies will love being in zone for Sherwood School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College. Sherwood Reserve and its much-loved Robin Hood playground are close by, and Browns Bay beach, village and transport are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully presented and ready for you. Call Becky or Bob today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\n• Brand new 2-level home with 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and 2 living areas\r\n• Master with balcony, walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and heat pump\r\n• Designer kitchen with fluted island, brass fittings and filtered water tap\r\n• Bathrooms with terrazzo floors, and a family bathroom with separate bath and shower\r\n• Fully fenced front lawn behind a white picket fence\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n• 10-year Stamford warranty\r\n• In zone for Sherwood School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n• Close to Sherwood Reserve, Browns Bay beach and village\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange a viewing.",
